WEBVTT

01:36.620 --> 01:39.979
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.030
[Episode 31]

02:14.340 --> 02:15.590
Hit me all you want.

02:15.590 --> 02:17.390
I won't fight back. Come on.

02:20.590 --> 02:22.460
Does it kill you to

02:22.490 --> 02:24.200
stay out of trouble?

02:28.060 --> 02:29.470
You didn't even ask me why.

02:29.470 --> 02:31.000
I don't care why!

02:31.030 --> 02:32.190
You beat someone up

02:32.190 --> 02:33.680
and they posted it online right away!

02:33.680 --> 02:35.280
I had a hard time stopping it from trending!

02:35.310 --> 02:36.360
He didn't see us as human.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.430
He deserved it!

02:38.410 --> 02:39.470
Shao Xingchi.

02:39.940 --> 02:41.300
Even now,

02:41.320 --> 02:43.320
do you still not get the severity of the situation?

02:43.350 --> 02:44.460
I'm ignorant.

02:44.490 --> 02:45.630
I don't understand the strange rules

02:45.630 --> 02:46.870
of your big company!

02:48.050 --> 02:48.820
Then

02:48.850 --> 02:49.800
you can ask me.

02:49.820 --> 02:50.820
Forget it, Xie Wanghe.

02:51.620 --> 02:53.320
I wish you'd hear me out instead.

02:56.200 --> 02:56.650
Go ahead.

02:56.670 --> 02:57.340
I'm listening.

02:57.370 --> 02:59.040
Let's hear what grievances you have.

02:59.060 --> 02:59.920
I hope

03:01.000 --> 03:02.280
that everyone who follows me

03:02.300 --> 03:03.770
can be treated as human beings,

03:03.970 --> 03:05.150
be accepted

03:05.190 --> 03:06.430
and respected.

03:06.640 --> 03:07.690
But you...

03:08.400 --> 03:10.360
you just treat them as tools

03:10.400 --> 03:11.840
for profit and expanding capital.

03:12.880 --> 03:13.690
And then?

03:15.880 --> 03:17.270
You weren't like this before.

03:18.380 --> 03:19.800
You were tough on the outside but soft-hearted.

03:19.800 --> 03:20.990
You were kind to everyone!

03:21.310 --> 03:22.800
I thought even if nobody understood me,

03:22.800 --> 03:23.800
you would!

03:23.800 --> 03:24.810
So what?

03:29.220 --> 03:30.730
We can't talk if you're going to be like this.

03:33.020 --> 03:34.079
Listen up.

03:34.100 --> 03:35.230
Do you know

03:35.250 --> 03:36.810
how many job opportunities

03:36.910 --> 03:39.740
Bee alone provides in a year?

03:39.760 --> 03:41.190
Do you know how many people

03:41.210 --> 03:43.240
make a living by delivering food?

03:43.260 --> 03:44.740
I understand you have a kind heart,

03:45.250 --> 03:47.390
but you can't be selfish!

03:48.360 --> 03:49.290
Back then,

03:49.710 --> 03:51.360
you said you wanted to be the station chief.

03:51.690 --> 03:53.310
I used stock options as collateral

03:53.400 --> 03:54.280
to make that happen.

03:54.710 --> 03:55.770
But what did you do?

03:56.829 --> 03:59.270
You led everyone with a heart of gold

03:59.720 --> 04:00.930
and almost

04:00.960 --> 04:02.990
ran the station into the ground.

04:03.010 --> 04:05.240
And your subordinates couldn't make money!

04:05.270 --> 04:06.810
All you talk about is making money.

04:07.230 --> 04:09.530
What about your conscience?

04:09.560 --> 04:11.090
Is making money that important?

04:12.340 --> 04:13.900
When you're very rich,

04:13.920 --> 04:15.950
you have the luxury to think money isn't important.

04:16.649 --> 04:17.950
But when everyone

04:17.980 --> 04:19.570
is waiting for their next meal,

04:19.589 --> 04:20.320
money

04:20.350 --> 04:21.519
is very important!

04:25.140 --> 04:25.910
I know

04:26.480 --> 04:28.160
you mean well.

04:28.900 --> 04:29.610
And then?

04:30.270 --> 04:31.500
They don't appreciate it.

04:33.820 --> 04:34.810
Then you

04:34.909 --> 04:36.200
pity their misfortune

04:36.300 --> 04:37.770
and bemoan their lack of ambition.

04:38.130 --> 04:40.610
You feel your well intentions are being treated like dirt.

04:40.740 --> 04:43.070
Do you feel particularly wronged?

04:43.200 --> 04:44.440
Delivery riders are humans too.

04:45.470 --> 04:46.850
They also need care

04:46.880 --> 04:48.159
and someone to protect

04:48.180 --> 04:49.210
their legal rights,

04:49.240 --> 04:49.920
you know?

04:49.950 --> 04:51.310
Did I withhold their pay?

04:53.270 --> 04:56.450
I even enhanced their commission and rewards!

04:57.750 --> 04:59.190
I provide job opportunities.

04:59.210 --> 05:00.770
If they take the job, they have to work.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.060
If they don't like it, they can leave.

05:02.080 --> 05:04.050
No one is forcing them to work themselves to death.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.100
The rules you set are inducing them to do that,

05:06.130 --> 05:06.970
you know?

05:09.390 --> 05:10.680
Listen up.

05:12.300 --> 05:13.810
In a competitive society,

05:14.120 --> 05:15.560
you're compensated according

05:16.120 --> 05:17.630
to the effort you put in.

05:17.900 --> 05:19.710
We're adults now!

05:19.740 --> 05:21.740
We're not kids playing house!

05:22.120 --> 05:24.500
We still can't satisfy everyone!

05:26.220 --> 05:27.370
Shao Xingchi.

05:28.060 --> 05:29.700
We're both Beijing drifters.

05:30.300 --> 05:31.780
After all these years,

05:31.980 --> 05:34.430
you know how much we've suffered.

05:35.590 --> 05:37.700
That's why I especially treasure this opportunity.

05:37.730 --> 05:38.780
I want to do a good job

05:38.810 --> 05:40.130
and prove myself.

05:40.650 --> 05:41.880
But what about you?

05:42.290 --> 05:44.580
With the opportunity I fought hard for,

05:44.600 --> 05:46.040
you want to realize a utopia.

05:46.070 --> 05:46.750
No problem.

05:46.800 --> 05:47.800
I support you.

05:47.800 --> 05:50.070
I hope your dreams come true.

05:50.350 --> 05:51.270
But...

05:53.500 --> 05:56.060
use your own money and resources to play house

05:56.080 --> 05:57.330
from now on.

05:58.540 --> 06:00.300
I wish you success!

06:41.940 --> 06:43.050
Where are you?

06:45.690 --> 06:46.330
What are you doing?

06:46.990 --> 06:47.630
Where are you?

06:47.630 --> 06:48.750
I'll come find you.

06:49.740 --> 06:50.390
Don't.

06:51.970 --> 06:53.290
Where are you?

06:56.550 --> 07:03.950
[Haikuo]

06:57.330 --> 06:58.570
Guess.

06:59.159 --> 07:00.720
I'll tell you if you guess right.

07:59.940 --> 08:01.000
What's wrong with you?

08:02.020 --> 08:03.300
We broke up.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.240
Who dumped whom?

08:07.940 --> 08:09.180
What do you think?

08:10.180 --> 08:10.910
Why?

08:16.450 --> 08:17.280
Speak up.

08:21.230 --> 08:23.130
Because I'm poor.

08:23.870 --> 08:25.160
What else could it be?

08:25.210 --> 08:27.230
Did you tell her you have stock options now?

08:28.600 --> 08:31.130
Do I need money to keep her?

08:31.150 --> 08:32.850
What else do you think you could rely on?

08:32.880 --> 08:34.179
Your good looks?

08:34.659 --> 08:35.870
Your abs?

08:35.890 --> 08:36.809
Do you have any?

08:38.270 --> 08:40.080
Stop trying to test human nature.

08:40.870 --> 08:41.750
It's pointless.

08:46.930 --> 08:47.880
Cut the crap.

08:48.580 --> 08:49.490
What's the matter?

08:57.480 --> 08:58.690
Xingchi and I...

08:59.740 --> 09:00.470
fell out.

09:04.060 --> 09:05.110
Aren't you surprised?

09:08.290 --> 09:10.430
How many times have you two fallen out?

09:10.760 --> 09:12.350
And you always say,

09:12.380 --> 09:14.330
"I'll never see him again!"

09:14.880 --> 09:15.770
And what happens?

09:20.510 --> 09:21.240
This time

09:23.140 --> 09:24.280
might be different.

09:32.260 --> 09:33.270
This incident

09:33.320 --> 09:34.480
has seriously

09:34.480 --> 09:36.480
damaged our company's image.

09:36.480 --> 09:39.040
Public opinion is spreading the issue.

09:39.590 --> 09:40.200
Mr. Meng.

09:41.440 --> 09:42.000
Come in.

09:50.960 --> 09:53.390
The Series D funding was about to be finalized,

09:53.420 --> 09:55.060
but because of Shao Xingchi's incident,

09:55.870 --> 09:57.120
it's been delayed again.

09:59.180 --> 09:59.940
I'm sorry.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.320
He's already resigned.

10:04.090 --> 10:05.120
As for his issue,

10:05.140 --> 10:06.440
I'll handle it appropriately.

10:07.200 --> 10:09.270
It's about time.

10:09.290 --> 10:10.630
That bastard

10:10.660 --> 10:12.590
is a bad apple.

10:15.030 --> 10:15.750
Alright.

10:19.140 --> 10:19.870
Let's talk business.

10:23.170 --> 10:24.090
Lately,

10:25.440 --> 10:27.160
the competition with Yuntu has intensified.

10:27.390 --> 10:28.220
The pressure is immense.

10:28.280 --> 10:30.250
I plan to apply for subsidies.

10:31.400 --> 10:32.770
Finally caved in, huh?

10:33.030 --> 10:34.390
Who was it

10:34.410 --> 10:36.640
who insisted on not taking subsidies?

10:37.390 --> 10:39.040
Times have changed.

10:39.180 --> 10:40.300
This time, the subsidies

10:40.750 --> 10:41.790
aren't for the delivery riders

10:42.130 --> 10:43.360
but for the businesses.

10:43.550 --> 10:45.370
We'll subsidize three to five yuan each

10:45.440 --> 10:47.200
for businesses who've worked with us.

10:47.220 --> 10:47.870
Also,

10:47.950 --> 10:49.000
we'll require them

10:49.020 --> 10:50.600
to sign exclusive contracts with us.

10:51.420 --> 10:53.570
That won't be easy.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.800
I've done some research.

10:54.820 --> 10:55.590
It's promising.

10:55.610 --> 10:57.930
Haikuo has analyzed it based on big data.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.010
Your buddy again?

10:59.870 --> 11:01.020
Can we trust him

11:01.040 --> 11:02.230
not to harm us this time?

11:02.860 --> 11:04.020
I firmly believe

11:04.590 --> 11:05.830
it'll work out this time.

11:08.540 --> 11:10.520
Who'll be in charge of this ground promotion?

11:12.900 --> 11:13.620
Give me some time

11:14.240 --> 11:15.600
to find someone suitable.

11:15.620 --> 11:18.500
Don't end up choosing another buddy of yours again.

11:18.530 --> 11:20.570
For a big company at our level,

11:20.600 --> 11:22.310
nepotism

11:22.340 --> 11:23.450
cannot happen again,

11:23.630 --> 11:24.270
okay?

11:43.910 --> 11:45.220
Mr. Qiu, what's your zodiac sign?

11:45.250 --> 11:45.980
Dog.

11:47.400 --> 11:48.460
No wonder.

11:51.420 --> 11:52.350
What do you mean?

11:55.290 --> 11:56.230
You bark madly

11:57.160 --> 11:58.160
and like to bite people.

11:58.900 --> 12:00.120
Have you had your shots?

12:04.570 --> 12:05.600
Xie Wanghe.

12:06.740 --> 12:08.030
Are you okay?

12:09.550 --> 12:11.960
Do you believe I can bite you to death?

12:12.940 --> 12:13.880
Mr. Qiu.

12:14.970 --> 12:16.160
In the business world,

12:16.530 --> 12:17.950
it's about capabilities.

12:18.860 --> 12:21.310
Tattling not only fails to accomplish anything

12:22.210 --> 12:23.680
but also makes others look down on you.

12:26.640 --> 12:27.510
I agree.

12:28.240 --> 12:30.890
I know I'm not very capable.

12:31.330 --> 12:34.670
If I can't succeed, I'll make sure you don't either.

12:35.860 --> 12:37.140
Behave yourself.

12:38.090 --> 12:40.390
Don't you dare cross me.

12:54.640 --> 12:56.260
[He Tianming]

12:57.680 --> 12:58.200
Hello?

12:58.860 --> 12:59.390
Mr. Xie.

12:59.410 --> 13:01.080
There's trouble at the station. Come quickly!

13:02.170 --> 13:03.070
Guys!

13:03.090 --> 13:04.370
We're done here. Let's go!

13:04.400 --> 13:05.390
All of you, come back!

13:07.800 --> 13:08.550
You can't leave!

13:08.630 --> 13:09.120
Move!

13:09.200 --> 13:09.750
Move, don't stop me!

13:09.750 --> 13:10.320
Get off!

13:10.390 --> 13:10.750
Get off the bike!

13:10.750 --> 13:11.400
Let go!

13:11.420 --> 13:12.000
Move!

13:12.030 --> 13:13.390
What's all this fuss about?

13:13.410 --> 13:13.970
Mr. Xie.

13:14.080 --> 13:14.550
I quit!

13:14.550 --> 13:15.390
Why can't I leave?

13:15.440 --> 13:16.420
This bike isn't yours!

13:16.510 --> 13:17.390
You didn't stop the others.

13:17.440 --> 13:18.440
Why just me?

13:19.970 --> 13:20.760
What's going on?

13:20.790 --> 13:21.560
Mr. Xie.

13:26.020 --> 13:27.150
It's like this.

13:27.180 --> 13:28.420
You... Get back!

13:28.450 --> 13:29.260
Explain!

13:30.440 --> 13:31.900
After Station Chief Shao's incident,

13:32.000 --> 13:33.350
many riders quit

13:33.370 --> 13:34.650
and even took the bikes with them.

13:35.160 --> 13:36.070
Back then,

13:36.130 --> 13:37.860
Station Chief Shao didn't collect

13:37.950 --> 13:38.950
deposits from them

13:38.980 --> 13:40.170
as they were young and poor.

13:40.200 --> 13:41.730
Are you serious?

13:42.750 --> 13:43.580
Before,

13:43.690 --> 13:45.370
Station Chief Shao vouched for them.

13:45.560 --> 13:47.370
I think he can get them back.

13:47.400 --> 13:48.620
He has resigned.

13:51.600 --> 13:52.730
Now,

13:53.370 --> 13:54.850
you'll be the chief of Station 203.

13:55.540 --> 13:56.360
I can't do it.

13:56.390 --> 13:57.800
It's not up to you!

13:59.720 --> 14:01.470
[Top Ten Exemplary Stations in China]

14:00.130 --> 14:02.210
Bravo!

14:01.590 --> 14:02.230
[Fenghua Express]

14:02.300 --> 14:02.770
[Loading Area]

14:05.290 --> 14:06.680
Bravo, bravo.

14:06.820 --> 14:07.580
Xia.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.610
Congrats.

14:09.170 --> 14:10.090
Thank you, Mr. Luo.

14:10.120 --> 14:12.130
Bravo!

14:14.930 --> 14:16.240
The company

14:16.260 --> 14:17.710
not only gave your station

14:17.740 --> 14:18.810
a certificate of honor

14:18.830 --> 14:20.830
but also awarded you 100,000 yuan.

14:20.860 --> 14:23.500
-Bravo!
-Thank you.

14:20.950 --> 14:27.210
[RMB 100,000]

14:23.520 --> 14:24.310
That's great!

14:24.340 --> 14:25.100
Bravo!

14:28.970 --> 14:29.730
Xia.

14:30.300 --> 14:32.300
Don't bother. I'll be off soon.

14:32.820 --> 14:33.580
Why the rush?

14:33.630 --> 14:34.320
Thank you.

14:34.610 --> 14:35.610
Besides giving you

14:35.640 --> 14:37.640
the bonus and certificate,

14:37.660 --> 14:39.090
I'm here on behalf of the company

14:39.120 --> 14:40.590
to invite you back to HQ

14:40.610 --> 14:41.900
to conduct training

14:41.930 --> 14:42.720
with your experience

14:42.740 --> 14:43.900
on business management.

14:44.900 --> 14:46.610
Is it long-term or...

14:47.850 --> 14:48.540
Let's sit and talk.

14:49.000 --> 14:49.760
It's like this.

14:51.020 --> 14:53.710
Be it the training or the PR department,

14:53.740 --> 14:55.230
you can join anytime

14:55.590 --> 14:57.380
to take charge of culture development.

14:57.410 --> 14:59.410
The senior management came to a unanimous consensus

14:59.430 --> 15:01.550
that you're the best candidate.

15:04.620 --> 15:06.140
I really want to go.

15:07.970 --> 15:08.780
You have concerns?

15:09.670 --> 15:10.900
Don't worry

15:11.060 --> 15:12.230
about the compensation.

15:12.260 --> 15:13.810
It'll definitely be improved.

15:14.850 --> 15:15.660
I don't have concerns.

15:16.340 --> 15:17.410
I have to go back to my hometown.

15:17.630 --> 15:18.360
Your hometown?

15:18.900 --> 15:19.980
Honghuai City

15:20.170 --> 15:21.080
in Jiangsu.

15:21.520 --> 15:22.890
A small city by the canal.

15:25.050 --> 15:26.390
Why so sudden?

15:27.190 --> 15:29.520
Did something happen at home?

15:30.890 --> 15:32.440
I've been drifting in Beijing for too long.

15:33.230 --> 15:34.350
I feel a bit empty.

15:35.790 --> 15:36.790
But thank you,

15:37.070 --> 15:38.900
and I appreciate the company's recognition.

15:40.440 --> 15:41.400
This certificate

15:41.530 --> 15:43.860
[Certificate of Honor]

15:42.090 --> 15:43.980
puts a perfect end

15:44.440 --> 15:45.910
to my life as a Beijing drifter.

15:49.280 --> 15:52.760
[Fenghua Express]

15:57.680 --> 15:59.330
Are you getting a promotion?

16:01.910 --> 16:02.910
But I didn't agree.

16:05.010 --> 16:06.330
Why not?

16:07.010 --> 16:09.830
I have more important things to do here.

16:10.280 --> 16:10.990
Auntie,

16:11.010 --> 16:12.420
add two more main dishes for dinner.

16:12.450 --> 16:13.180
Let's celebrate.

16:13.230 --> 16:14.020
Sure.

16:14.050 --> 16:15.150
What do you want to eat?

16:15.790 --> 16:16.630
I'm fine with anything.

16:16.650 --> 16:17.830
Make something everyone likes.

16:17.860 --> 16:19.120
Mom, Fenghua.

16:19.320 --> 16:19.960
Tianming?

16:20.290 --> 16:21.790
Back so early?

16:21.790 --> 16:23.260
Xingchi is in trouble.

16:38.040 --> 16:40.180
Eating fried bean sauce noodles in a bar.

16:40.340 --> 16:41.410
What refined taste.

16:47.910 --> 16:48.630
What's wrong?

16:50.510 --> 16:52.240
Xie Wanghe came here last time too.

16:53.510 --> 16:54.870
He said the same thing as you.

16:59.910 --> 17:01.510
Don't tell me you're here to...

17:02.090 --> 17:03.560
help us patch things up?

17:06.160 --> 17:07.480
I'm not that idle.

17:11.230 --> 17:12.410
He and I...

17:12.920 --> 17:14.270
haven't been in touch for a long time.

17:19.440 --> 17:20.030
Why?

17:21.790 --> 17:22.480
We're busy.

17:25.329 --> 17:27.670
But weren't you two...

17:29.110 --> 17:29.970
Weren't what?

17:35.160 --> 17:35.770
Nothing.

17:38.070 --> 17:40.340
Xie Wanghe and I just aren't friends anymore.

17:40.510 --> 17:41.520
We're not enemies.

17:42.640 --> 17:43.400
That's just how it is.

17:48.990 --> 17:51.000
So what do you want to do next?

17:52.200 --> 17:53.720
I have a buddy who opened a shop,

17:55.420 --> 17:56.680
modifying off-road vehicles.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.590
I want to give it a try.

17:58.330 --> 17:59.110
Is it profitable?

18:01.160 --> 18:02.310
I don't know. We'll see.

18:06.350 --> 18:07.200
How about...

18:08.110 --> 18:09.350
you come work with me?

18:20.270 --> 18:23.390
First, when loading, put small items inside the vehicle

18:23.420 --> 18:25.200
and secure large items on the roof.

18:25.220 --> 18:25.920
Second,

18:25.960 --> 18:28.750
during scanning, pay attention to sorting loose items

18:28.830 --> 18:30.040
and residential items.

18:30.160 --> 18:31.160
Third,

18:30.210 --> 18:34.170
[Sorting Area (Urban Area)]

18:31.200 --> 18:32.400
report problems you can't solve

18:32.400 --> 18:34.270
to the problem department promptly.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.320
It's that simple.

18:35.350 --> 18:37.190
I believe you'll be set in one afternoon.

18:36.950 --> 18:40.050
[Zhongguancun South Road]

18:38.710 --> 18:40.740
Ms. Xia, you really want to recruit me, huh?

18:42.600 --> 18:44.360
What, you want to back out?

18:44.390 --> 18:45.330
I wouldn't dare.

18:46.600 --> 18:47.890
Then get to work.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.930
If you don't do well, you won't get dinner tonight.

18:53.010 --> 18:54.530
You've really been a boss for too long.

18:54.550 --> 18:55.850
You're getting more and more

18:55.880 --> 18:57.230
like Liang's dad.

18:59.350 --> 19:03.020
[Fenghua Express]
[Express delivery makes your life more efficient]

18:59.550 --> 19:01.420
Okay, okay. I was wrong, I was wrong.

19:01.450 --> 19:02.540
Do you surrender?

19:02.560 --> 19:03.230
I surrender!

19:03.260 --> 19:04.290
You're breaking my neck!

19:06.010 --> 19:07.730
If I'd known it'd be like this, I wouldn't have come.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.220
Even more brutal than Xie Wanghe.

19:10.240 --> 19:11.000
Brutal?

19:13.090 --> 19:14.290
Wanghe?

19:14.320 --> 19:15.750
You said I'm brutal?

19:16.320 --> 19:17.400
Don't like that?

19:18.970 --> 19:20.240
I'll say something you'd prefer.

19:20.240 --> 19:21.730
How about I call you cold-blooded?

19:22.150 --> 19:23.840
You can say it to my face.

19:25.230 --> 19:26.490
But talking behind someone's back

19:27.350 --> 19:28.390
isn't classy.

19:28.980 --> 19:33.940
[Fenghua Express]
[We're the experts in shipping parcels]

19:35.400 --> 19:36.400
You know his temper.

19:36.400 --> 19:38.280
Will it kill you to lay off him?

19:39.230 --> 19:42.500
[Fenghua Express]

19:40.460 --> 19:41.270
Wanghe.

19:42.160 --> 19:42.830
Wanghe!

19:49.500 --> 19:51.740
Wanghe, wait up.

19:51.760 --> 19:53.280
I can't run anymore.

19:58.060 --> 20:00.090
Fenghua, what's wrong?

20:01.080 --> 20:02.320
What's wrong?

20:11.350 --> 20:12.060
Here.

20:12.550 --> 20:13.550
Have some soup.

20:23.030 --> 20:24.010
Feeling better?

20:27.480 --> 20:29.520
Why are you so weak now?

20:29.690 --> 20:32.000
Out of breath after a few steps?

20:33.980 --> 20:35.590
I'm just a bit anemic.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.040
It's your fault for running so fast.

20:38.060 --> 20:39.360
I couldn't catch up.

20:39.500 --> 20:40.870
I almost couldn't catch my breath.

20:49.480 --> 20:51.310
Xingchi wasn't happy working for you,

20:51.880 --> 20:53.160
so I asked him to come help me.

20:53.540 --> 20:55.070
He caused such a big mess,

20:55.590 --> 20:56.830
but he still won't admit it.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.400
He's unhappy?

21:00.590 --> 21:01.350
Yes.

21:02.030 --> 21:04.310
Hitting a customer is a bit too much.

21:05.550 --> 21:06.420
A bit?

21:07.760 --> 21:09.190
It's way too much.

21:09.220 --> 21:10.780
If it were me, I'd fire him too.

21:10.800 --> 21:12.360
I didn't fire him.

21:12.440 --> 21:14.440
He resigned on his own.

21:14.470 --> 21:15.440
Because of this incident,

21:15.460 --> 21:17.320
I have to keep my head down at the company.

21:17.350 --> 21:19.240
I'm swamped with work stuff every day,

21:19.270 --> 21:21.000
and I still have to chase after bikes for him.

21:21.020 --> 21:22.100
Why should I have to do that?

21:24.870 --> 21:27.290
So you think you've done nothing wrong?

21:27.680 --> 21:28.720
What did I do wrong?

21:30.030 --> 21:31.400
He's your buddy.

21:31.630 --> 21:33.910
When he does something wrong, talk to him properly.

21:33.960 --> 21:35.310
How else am I supposed to talk to him?

21:35.350 --> 21:36.550
Why does he listen to me then?

21:36.550 --> 21:39.000
If you told him to jump off a building, he'd do it!

21:45.590 --> 21:47.350
Fenghua, I know you mean well,

21:47.370 --> 21:49.000
but you can't take sides.

21:49.720 --> 21:51.440
How am I taking sides?

21:54.510 --> 21:56.940
You think I'm just a heartless capitalist.

21:56.970 --> 21:58.580
I'm doing better than Xingchi,

21:58.600 --> 22:00.280
so you unconsciously assume

22:00.310 --> 22:01.620
that I'm bullying him.

22:01.640 --> 22:02.370
Right?

22:02.780 --> 22:04.130
But I'm not.

22:04.440 --> 22:06.400
I'm just an employee too.

22:06.630 --> 22:08.630
My business card says "CEO Assistant,"

22:08.650 --> 22:09.540
but in fact,

22:09.570 --> 22:10.610
I don't even have the authority

22:10.630 --> 22:12.020
of a VP!

22:12.310 --> 22:14.510
I had to use all the credibility

22:14.720 --> 22:16.030
I've built up

22:16.030 --> 22:17.950
to resolve the huge mistake Xingchi made!

22:20.270 --> 22:20.990
Fenghua.

22:22.400 --> 22:24.050
You can side with your friend over reason,

22:25.250 --> 22:27.320
but please don't think I'm bullying him

22:27.350 --> 22:28.830
just because he's weaker

22:28.850 --> 22:30.620
and deserving of sympathy.

22:30.640 --> 22:32.360
That's unfair to me!

22:45.820 --> 22:52.180
[Wankelai Supermarket Community Store]

22:48.750 --> 22:50.190
You're earning quite a lot.

22:50.220 --> 22:51.340
That's enough.

22:55.270 --> 22:57.110
Always rushing us. Do it yourself then!

22:57.130 --> 22:58.440
Or you could fine me.

23:00.120 --> 23:01.510
Time's so tight, you know?

23:03.880 --> 23:06.700
Some customers call me just to rush me.

23:06.940 --> 23:07.920
It isn't even time yet,

23:07.920 --> 23:08.830
but they have to call me.

23:08.830 --> 23:09.920
Isn't that unfair?

23:13.050 --> 23:14.090
Xingchi!

23:14.120 --> 23:15.800
Why are you here?

23:16.100 --> 23:16.830
Xingchi.

23:16.830 --> 23:17.830
How have you been?

23:17.830 --> 23:18.920
Good. Not bad.

23:20.110 --> 23:21.920
Why are you eating out here?

23:21.940 --> 23:24.900
Um... the cafeteria is closed.

23:25.640 --> 23:26.870
Closed? Why?

23:29.020 --> 23:30.870
Maybe the superiors think it wastes time.

23:31.030 --> 23:31.790
What?

23:32.800 --> 23:34.820
How's having your meals wasting time?

23:35.130 --> 23:36.680
Besides, that cafeteria was cheap

23:36.680 --> 23:37.850
and clean.

23:39.060 --> 23:39.670
Xingchi.

23:40.000 --> 23:40.750
Since we

23:40.750 --> 23:42.640
go back just to eat a meal,

23:42.680 --> 23:44.730
it wastes a lot of time on the road.

23:44.990 --> 23:46.750
Well, just to save a few pennies,

23:46.750 --> 23:49.110
it's not really worth it. So we're here.

23:54.360 --> 23:55.480
If you can't have a proper meal,

23:55.480 --> 23:56.830
how can you have the energy to work?

23:58.440 --> 23:59.480
Ridiculous!

24:05.090 --> 24:07.090
I just bought some bread and drinks.

24:08.740 --> 24:10.030
Have it if you're still hungry.

24:12.510 --> 24:13.670
[Wankelai Supermarket Community Store]

24:14.040 --> 24:18.240
[Wankelai Supermarket Community Store]

24:16.080 --> 24:16.810
Xingchi.

24:18.340 --> 24:19.250
Take a look.

24:22.530 --> 24:22.870
[Bee Delivery]
[Proposal to modify the employees' meal management]

24:22.960 --> 24:27.130
[How to manage daily meals of employees]

24:27.200 --> 24:28.090
[Notice on the implementation of employee meal subsidies]

24:27.390 --> 24:28.920
Is this necessary?

24:29.270 --> 24:31.740
Executives' meals can be invoiced and reimbursed.

24:31.800 --> 24:33.940
Why do we have to stick to one specific restaurant?

24:33.970 --> 24:35.260
They offer a discount

24:35.480 --> 24:37.000
of 40% for bulk purchases.

24:37.240 --> 24:38.620
We can also bring our own drinks.

24:38.640 --> 24:40.320
More importantly, it's close to the office.

24:40.360 --> 24:41.710
We can sign the bills right after eating.

24:41.730 --> 24:43.350
It saves us the reimbursement process.

24:43.980 --> 24:45.100
What's the point?

24:46.530 --> 24:48.440
Our scale is getting bigger and bigger.

24:48.470 --> 24:49.600
We need to simplify processes.

24:49.620 --> 24:51.520
Use our manpower only where it matters most.

24:55.110 --> 24:55.640
Alright.

24:56.160 --> 24:57.670
In the future, for minor matters like this,

24:57.700 --> 24:59.060
you can decide on your own.

24:59.080 --> 25:00.260
No need to consult me.

25:02.720 --> 25:03.550
Um...

25:04.930 --> 25:06.020
what about employee benefits?

25:07.640 --> 25:08.200
For delivery riders?

25:08.220 --> 25:08.680
Yes.

25:09.390 --> 25:10.830
Previously, Shao Xingchi

25:11.160 --> 25:13.500
set up a cafeteria at Station 203

25:13.750 --> 25:14.920
to provide boxed meals to the riders.

25:14.920 --> 25:15.880
The results were decent.

25:16.070 --> 25:17.870
I want to promote this at other stations.

25:20.750 --> 25:23.310
He almost messed up Station 203.

25:23.590 --> 25:24.680
It's been proven

25:24.680 --> 25:26.260
that his ideas are not worth following.

25:26.590 --> 25:28.640
It didn't increase the workers' cohesion either.

25:29.030 --> 25:31.310
Otherwise, when Shao Xingchi was fired,

25:31.340 --> 25:33.540
the station's staff would've rioted.

25:39.920 --> 25:40.680
Get back to work.

25:42.310 --> 25:43.130
Okay.

26:12.360 --> 26:13.430
Meat skewers?

26:16.770 --> 26:18.330
How's your nose so sharp?

26:19.590 --> 26:20.960
Can't you be wrong for once?

26:31.200 --> 26:32.200
Look at this.

26:32.490 --> 26:33.720
Won't you get pricked?

26:37.500 --> 26:39.070
Stay if you want.

26:39.530 --> 26:41.770
If not, you can leave.

26:45.480 --> 26:46.360
Perfect.

26:47.640 --> 26:48.910
I'm frustrated too.

26:49.200 --> 26:50.190
I'll drink with you.

26:50.940 --> 26:51.720
Come on.

27:01.240 --> 27:02.660
At your station,

27:03.210 --> 27:04.980
many delivery riders have run off.

27:05.400 --> 27:06.690
Many bikes were taken

27:07.000 --> 27:08.550
when they didn't pay the deposit.

27:08.960 --> 27:10.110
Tell Xie Wanghe...

27:12.390 --> 27:14.400
I'll get back all the stolen bikes for him.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.680
For those that I can't,

27:17.220 --> 27:19.080
I'll pay out of my own pocket.

27:19.520 --> 27:21.210
Why don't you tell him yourself?

27:25.240 --> 27:26.320
No thanks.

27:27.100 --> 27:28.850
Even his face irks me now.

27:30.280 --> 27:31.280
This time,

27:31.930 --> 27:33.500
how long do you plan to keep this up?

27:35.200 --> 27:36.200
For a lifetime, I guess.

27:38.920 --> 27:39.640
Haikuo.

27:40.020 --> 27:41.160
Don't try to persuade me.

27:41.900 --> 27:42.990
Wanghe's right too.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.440
We came to Beijing to make money.

27:46.010 --> 27:47.290
But I don't think I'm wrong either.

27:49.480 --> 27:51.420
I just want to live humanely.

28:06.780 --> 28:08.890
[Shuntong Express]

28:07.290 --> 28:08.990
Auntie, he's over there.

28:09.150 --> 28:10.280
Thank you, thank you.

28:09.530 --> 28:14.750
[Shuntong Express]

28:10.310 --> 28:12.610
Wang Yuan, did you get into a fight?

28:13.310 --> 28:15.050
Mom? Why are you here?

28:15.230 --> 28:16.480
Your aunt saw news online

28:16.480 --> 28:18.960
that said you beat up customers and got sued.

28:18.960 --> 28:20.790
Listen to me first. Come here.

28:20.830 --> 28:23.440
Mom, can you not listen to that nonsense online?

28:23.480 --> 28:25.720
It's all rubbish. I didn't hit anyone.

28:25.720 --> 28:27.440
So what exactly happened?

28:27.480 --> 28:29.070
I was just delivering food as usual.

28:29.110 --> 28:30.550
That customer was bullying me.

28:30.580 --> 28:32.210
Xingchi saw it and realized it.

28:32.230 --> 28:33.300
So he got upset.

28:34.620 --> 28:36.030
Shao Xingchi?

28:36.060 --> 28:38.260
That guy who runs a karaoke studio?

28:40.720 --> 28:41.760
Including this time,

28:41.780 --> 28:43.440
he's fought for me twice.

28:43.460 --> 28:44.900
He even lost his job because of it.

28:54.450 --> 28:59.880
[Notice Board of Fenghua Express]

28:58.770 --> 28:59.550
Auntie.

29:02.600 --> 29:03.360
Xingchi.

29:03.390 --> 29:05.400
Auntie! Why are you here?

29:06.410 --> 29:07.420
Xingchi.

29:08.030 --> 29:09.350
What are you doing?

29:12.350 --> 29:13.030
Come on.

29:13.060 --> 29:14.290
Let's talk inside. Come on.

29:15.370 --> 29:16.090
Here.

29:21.720 --> 29:22.750
-Have some water.
-Thank you.

29:24.100 --> 29:26.600
My son Wang Yuan is kind-hearted,

29:27.230 --> 29:28.960
but he's just so stubborn.

29:28.960 --> 29:32.430
He refuses to come and apologize in person, no matter what.

29:33.060 --> 29:36.640
I'm really sorry about this time.

29:36.680 --> 29:38.620
You've been wronged.

29:39.480 --> 29:41.830
It's okay, Auntie. I don't blame him.

29:42.140 --> 29:43.280
Let's put this behind us.

29:45.900 --> 29:48.590
Wang Yuan's done you wrong, my child.

29:48.620 --> 29:49.940
I'm sorry.

29:49.960 --> 29:51.450
As his mother...

29:51.860 --> 29:53.540
Here, my child.

29:54.020 --> 29:55.050
Take this.

29:55.590 --> 29:57.670
Auntie, I told you this is behind us.

29:57.720 --> 29:59.180
No, listen to me.

29:59.210 --> 30:02.050
You've taken care of me and my son for so many years.

30:02.250 --> 30:04.180
I remember your kindness.

30:04.220 --> 30:05.400
Take this money

30:05.400 --> 30:07.750
and I'll feel a bit better.

30:08.050 --> 30:09.370
It's not much.

30:09.400 --> 30:10.860
Just take it. Let me

30:10.890 --> 30:13.350
buy peace of mind from you, okay?

30:14.670 --> 30:16.480
Take it, my dear child.

30:17.030 --> 30:17.900
Take it.

30:19.270 --> 30:21.650
We came to live in Beijing

30:21.680 --> 30:24.720
because we'd be closer to our son

30:24.720 --> 30:27.170
and we thought we'd earn more than back home.

30:27.370 --> 30:29.800
But after coming here, we realized...

30:31.240 --> 30:34.550
it's not that simple.

30:43.730 --> 30:46.700
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

30:47.980 --> 30:51.200
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

30:52.330 --> 30:54.830
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

30:54.750 --> 30:57.030
Why is there a flood again?

30:55.740 --> 31:00.040
♫Listening as time drifts by♫

30:57.070 --> 30:58.220
Hurry up!

30:58.410 --> 30:59.850
Quick, come up! There's no more!

30:59.920 --> 31:00.820
Niu!

31:01.530 --> 31:04.210
Stop the water! Get the blankets!

31:01.720 --> 31:05.770
♫The sunsets in the city♫

31:05.110 --> 31:06.440
Get a blanket!

31:06.140 --> 31:10.270
♫Hold no poetry, no distant dreams♫

31:06.440 --> 31:07.480
Come on, come on!

31:07.480 --> 31:08.920
Use the blankets to block it!

31:08.920 --> 31:09.640
Hurry!

31:11.080 --> 31:14.330
♫Walking through a world like a song♫

31:15.530 --> 31:19.190
♫From oblivion to oblivion♫

31:19.920 --> 31:23.590
♫The love that passed through those remaining years♫

31:24.330 --> 31:27.600
♫Without complaints or piano music♫

31:28.890 --> 31:32.130
♫The coolness after the gentle breeze♫

31:31.120 --> 31:31.740
[Mom]

31:31.920 --> 31:40.180
[There's a rainstorm these few days. Always have an umbrella with you. Don't catch a cold.]

31:33.130 --> 31:37.010
♫I'm destined to be like you♫

31:46.790 --> 31:49.370
♫Far away, so far away♫

31:50.470 --> 31:53.510
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

31:54.830 --> 31:57.240
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

31:57.840 --> 32:02.410
♫Listening to the river flow♫

32:34.200 --> 32:36.010
What are you sneaking around for?

32:36.040 --> 32:37.140
None of your business.

32:37.760 --> 32:38.720
Why are you here?

32:39.910 --> 32:40.670
Nothing.

32:41.590 --> 32:43.160
Then get out of here.

32:43.920 --> 32:46.350
Is it appropriate for a man and a woman to be together at night?

32:47.390 --> 32:48.070
Huh?

32:48.920 --> 32:50.310
Does that bother you?

32:50.350 --> 32:51.160
Am I not a woman?

32:51.200 --> 32:53.240
Okay, yes, I was wrong.

32:53.240 --> 32:55.310
I was wrong. I was wrong, happy?

33:03.210 --> 33:04.410
What do you want?

33:16.720 --> 33:17.810
I want to go home.

33:21.540 --> 33:22.450
What?

33:23.220 --> 33:24.520
Want to be a deserter?

33:27.280 --> 33:28.710
I've always been holding back...

33:31.330 --> 33:32.830
thinking once I get settled down,

33:32.830 --> 33:33.960
I'd bring my mom over.

33:35.090 --> 33:36.890
But now when I look around,

33:38.090 --> 33:39.720
others' moms who came to Beijing

33:39.720 --> 33:40.880
all seem unhappy.

33:42.200 --> 33:44.480
No relatives, friends, or neighbors around.

33:45.710 --> 33:46.440
No one to talk to

33:46.480 --> 33:47.960
when they are tired or bored.

33:49.160 --> 33:50.290
Always one short for mahjong.

33:52.050 --> 33:53.160
Rather than this,

33:54.520 --> 33:55.830
I might as well go back home.

34:01.480 --> 34:05.050
I was planning to give you this station.

34:05.480 --> 34:06.400
Give it to me?

34:07.240 --> 34:08.360
Then what'd you do?

34:10.760 --> 34:11.800
Go home.

34:14.900 --> 34:16.190
That year,

34:16.960 --> 34:18.480
all of you were coming to Beijing.

34:20.010 --> 34:21.380
I thought...

34:23.050 --> 34:24.929
I'd be the only one left behind.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.770
How boring.

34:26.960 --> 34:29.440
You'd all be broadening your horizons in Beijing,

34:29.480 --> 34:30.710
while I'd be stuck at home.

34:30.960 --> 34:33.429
When we meet again in a few years,

34:33.480 --> 34:35.219
I'd have become all reserved.

34:35.239 --> 34:36.480
I'd have to bow to you all

34:36.480 --> 34:37.920
and call you "Sir."

34:38.360 --> 34:39.469
It wouldn't be that bad.

34:39.489 --> 34:40.949
I didn't know back then.

34:41.739 --> 34:43.380
I was just scared

34:44.650 --> 34:45.699
of being left behind.

34:49.139 --> 34:50.960
That's why I came to Beijing.

34:54.270 --> 34:56.100
But after all these years in Beijing...

34:58.670 --> 35:00.150
I'm really exhausted.

35:02.960 --> 35:05.030
Every day is exhausting.

35:07.440 --> 35:08.770
Now I feel...

35:09.920 --> 35:10.710
it's not worth it.

35:15.480 --> 35:16.280
Then go back.

35:16.920 --> 35:17.840
Let's go back together.

35:17.880 --> 35:18.920
Come on.

35:21.630 --> 35:24.670
When we get back, I'll take care of you.

35:31.360 --> 35:33.030
Following Typhoon Huahuo,

35:33.030 --> 35:34.880
Typhoon Haike'er, the seventh of the year,

35:34.900 --> 35:36.310
has formed this morning.

35:36.440 --> 35:37.030
In the future,

35:37.070 --> 35:39.190
it'll either circle back or move slowly.

35:39.230 --> 35:41.480
Rain will spread from the eastern part of northwestern Sichuan

35:41.480 --> 35:43.030
all the way to the North China region.

35:43.110 --> 35:44.800
The deeper the area, the stronger the rainfall.

35:44.840 --> 35:45.440
In Beijing,

35:45.480 --> 35:46.320
in the afternoon,

35:46.320 --> 35:47.550
it will even be as dark as night.

35:47.590 --> 35:48.930
Are you confident

35:49.490 --> 35:50.770
in this battle?

35:53.070 --> 35:54.400
I don't know about confidence,

35:55.060 --> 35:58.520
but our entire team will fight to the death.

35:59.710 --> 36:00.800
That's not enough.

36:03.150 --> 36:04.880
To win this battle,

36:04.920 --> 36:06.300
the company has invested heavily.

36:06.320 --> 36:08.070
They've raised the subsidies to the max limit.

36:08.100 --> 36:09.410
If we lose,

36:09.570 --> 36:11.380
the investors will abandon us.

36:11.410 --> 36:12.930
We'll have to forget about Series D funding.

36:12.950 --> 36:14.710
So if we fail this battle,

36:15.790 --> 36:16.850
we'll be doomed.

36:19.340 --> 36:20.180
Understood.

36:20.210 --> 36:21.730
Okay. Okay.

36:23.420 --> 36:24.450
Got it.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.560
Definitely.

36:31.010 --> 36:32.570
There will be heavy rain for the next three days.

36:32.600 --> 36:33.860
It's a tough battle ahead of us.

36:33.920 --> 36:35.800
Delivering food in this heavy rain?

36:35.820 --> 36:37.650
The higher-ups are just thinking about themselves.

36:37.760 --> 36:38.670
Do they have any idea

36:38.710 --> 36:40.510
how tough it is on us riders?

36:40.530 --> 36:41.700
We have no choice.

36:41.750 --> 36:43.660
Who orders food when the weather's good?

36:44.980 --> 36:46.060
Let everyone know that

36:46.090 --> 36:48.180
tomorrow morning's meeting starts half an hour earlier.

36:48.200 --> 36:49.360
Get everyone mobilized.

36:49.390 --> 36:52.310
Chief, shouldn't we hire more people?

36:52.330 --> 36:54.330
Many have quit in the past few days.

36:54.360 --> 36:56.070
The new hires are all rookies.

36:56.090 --> 36:57.600
When the orders start pouring in,

36:57.630 --> 36:58.840
we can't handle it.

36:58.860 --> 37:00.170
I've brought this up with them.

37:00.200 --> 37:01.480
The company is in a tight spot too.

37:01.710 --> 37:03.400
We're already short-staffed.

37:03.700 --> 37:05.950
Other platforms are poaching people everywhere.

37:06.480 --> 37:07.840
We have to figure it out ourselves.

37:07.860 --> 37:09.070
An order for two.

37:11.260 --> 37:13.120
Sorry, Mr. Xie. Thank you for waiting.

37:13.560 --> 37:14.460
Take a look.

37:14.800 --> 37:16.150
Isn't business booming?

37:16.570 --> 37:19.390
When lunchtime comes around,

37:19.420 --> 37:21.380
our dozens of franchises receive

37:21.400 --> 37:22.800
thousands of orders.

37:22.830 --> 37:23.870
Your platform alone

37:23.890 --> 37:24.930
might not be able

37:24.960 --> 37:26.170
to handle such a large volume.

37:26.190 --> 37:27.870
Why don't I sign with some others too?

37:27.900 --> 37:29.460
Don't worry about that.

37:29.480 --> 37:31.380
We can handle any number of orders.

37:31.920 --> 37:33.030
Either we're exclusive

37:33.050 --> 37:34.610
or we terminate our cooperation.

37:34.640 --> 37:35.930
The choice is yours.

37:37.360 --> 37:38.550
Must it be this way, Mr. Xie?

37:38.570 --> 37:40.780
I think if everyone does business

37:40.810 --> 37:42.120
the way you do,

37:42.140 --> 37:44.620
our industry will eventually be ruined.

37:45.650 --> 37:47.070
Just make your choice.

37:47.100 --> 37:48.110
No need for opinions.

37:51.350 --> 37:52.290
Mr. Xie!

37:52.620 --> 37:54.070
Give me more time to consider.

37:54.370 --> 37:55.820
-Mr. Xie.
-Mr. Xie.

37:56.150 --> 37:56.630
Mr. Xie.

37:56.630 --> 37:57.510
Our market share in Haidian

37:57.590 --> 37:59.030
is basically on par with Yuntu now.

38:00.190 --> 38:02.190
The last leg of the journey is the toughest.

38:02.210 --> 38:04.280
We've just caught up with them.

38:04.310 --> 38:07.110
There are even tougher battles ahead.

38:07.310 --> 38:09.610
This noon, we're basically on par with Yuntu,

38:09.710 --> 38:11.360
but they're pushing hard on their delivery speed.

38:11.380 --> 38:13.130
They've reduced it to 32 minutes.

38:14.270 --> 38:16.160
Are they out of their minds?

38:16.480 --> 38:17.550
The weather forecast shows

38:17.590 --> 38:19.410
heavy rain in Beijing for the next three days.

38:21.650 --> 38:23.010
Did everyone hear that?

38:23.070 --> 38:24.790
For the food delivery industry,

38:24.920 --> 38:27.070
bad weather is our peak season.

38:27.090 --> 38:28.970
Even the heavens are helping us.

38:29.300 --> 38:30.760
Issue a notice immediately.

38:30.760 --> 38:32.230
Mobilize everyone.

38:32.230 --> 38:34.150
We have to face the challenge of the upcoming bad weather.

38:34.150 --> 38:35.440
Within these three days,

38:35.480 --> 38:37.340
we must take our business volume to a new level.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.030
Got it.

38:38.110 --> 38:38.800
Listen up.

38:40.240 --> 38:41.870
We're just one push away

38:41.890 --> 38:43.450
from defeating Yuntu.

38:43.520 --> 38:44.600
Are you confident?

38:44.760 --> 38:45.440
Yes!

38:45.480 --> 38:46.280
Let's go to war!

38:57.150 --> 38:57.960
Tianming!

38:58.480 --> 38:59.360
Tianming!

38:59.380 --> 39:00.230
Mom, go home.

39:00.280 --> 39:02.510
It's raining so hard. Why don't you take a day off?

39:02.550 --> 39:03.960
Go with your wife for a prenatal check-up.

39:03.960 --> 39:04.670
I can't.

39:04.760 --> 39:06.230
Everyone's working, I...

39:06.280 --> 39:07.360
I can't rest. Bye.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.880
Does the world stop spinning without you?

39:08.880 --> 39:10.020
Enough, okay?

39:10.110 --> 39:10.920
I'll come back once I'm done.

39:10.920 --> 39:13.000
Don't worry, go ahead. I'll go with her.

39:13.070 --> 39:14.630
Be careful. Please be safe.

39:14.630 --> 39:15.670
Thanks, Fenghua.

39:15.940 --> 39:16.760
Such heavy rain!

39:16.760 --> 39:17.670
Be careful on the road.

39:17.710 --> 39:18.700
Okay, okay.

39:18.920 --> 39:21.190
Be careful in this heavy rain!

39:21.880 --> 39:22.920
Starting from today,

39:22.920 --> 39:25.440
we're on call 24/7 for the next three days!

39:25.480 --> 39:28.480
This time, we absolutely can't have a single order cancelled!

39:28.480 --> 39:29.260
Got it!

39:29.440 --> 39:30.300
Set off!

39:30.400 --> 39:31.390
Be safe!

39:44.020 --> 39:48.740
[Data Center] [Dispatching Center]

39:50.550 --> 39:52.550
Mr. Xie, there are too many orders today.

39:52.550 --> 39:53.440
We can't handle it.

39:53.480 --> 39:54.840
Make it work, no matter what.

39:54.860 --> 39:57.130
How about extending the delivery time by one minute?

39:59.920 --> 40:02.190
Now's the time to compete on speed.

40:02.210 --> 40:03.850
Whoever is faster wins.

40:03.880 --> 40:05.800
Do you know how important one minute is?

40:05.910 --> 40:09.200
[Data Center] [Dispatching Center]

40:06.340 --> 40:07.360
Close-range deliveries done.

40:07.400 --> 40:09.550
Assign these two. Here. Here. Quick!

40:09.550 --> 40:11.400
Chief! Chief! We have a problem!

40:11.480 --> 40:12.960
Several of our riders' batteries are soaked.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.700
Spare batteries. Hurry!

40:19.480 --> 40:20.480
Take it easy.

40:20.480 --> 40:21.030
Be careful.

40:21.110 --> 40:21.880
I'll go grab orders.

40:21.920 --> 40:22.440
Go, go, go!

40:22.890 --> 40:25.870
[Everyone is responsible for fire safety]

40:25.920 --> 40:26.850
Grab orders now.

40:26.880 --> 40:28.140
Dispatch mine too.

40:28.370 --> 40:33.130
[Data Center] [Dispatching Center]

40:33.710 --> 40:35.070
Your prediction was spot on.

40:35.070 --> 40:36.920
Today's orders have increased by 30%.

40:36.920 --> 40:37.920
Same for Yuntu,

40:37.920 --> 40:39.510
but their absolute numbers aren't as high as ours.

40:40.690 --> 40:42.360
Good, keep pushing.

40:42.390 --> 40:43.290
Tell everyone

40:43.310 --> 40:45.350
that no one stops until the very last moment.

40:45.380 --> 40:46.320
Understood.

41:02.330 --> 41:05.880
[Data Center] [Dispatching Center]

41:06.330 --> 41:07.800
Has my meal been delivered?

41:07.800 --> 41:09.290
Right away. Sorry about that.

41:09.430 --> 41:09.950
Okay.

41:14.870 --> 41:17.220
[Data Center] [Dispatching Center]

41:19.740 --> 41:21.310
I really envy you.

41:24.630 --> 41:25.710
Leaving just like that.

41:25.760 --> 41:27.800
At this age, you're still so willful.

41:28.710 --> 41:31.650
I couldn't make it anymore and got eliminated, okay?

41:32.030 --> 41:32.750
Excuses.

41:32.800 --> 41:34.000
It's true.

41:34.070 --> 41:36.190
I used to think I was just unlucky.

41:36.230 --> 41:38.260
Now sometimes, I think I'm just stupid.

41:38.740 --> 41:40.810
I've really failed at everything I've tried.

41:41.690 --> 41:43.330
You just haven't learned your lesson.

41:43.770 --> 41:44.770
Is that it?

41:46.840 --> 41:48.920
To get things done, it's not about your capabilities

41:48.920 --> 41:50.480
but patience and perseverance.

41:50.510 --> 41:53.150
Wanghe is indeed better than us in this regard.

41:54.320 --> 41:55.110
That's why

41:56.210 --> 41:57.650
he's more successful than us.

42:00.710 --> 42:01.840
He knows you're leaving.

42:02.630 --> 42:03.960
He wanted to come see you off,

42:04.480 --> 42:06.240
but he's really too busy.

42:06.400 --> 42:07.190
It's okay.

42:09.060 --> 42:10.690
It's not like you won't be coming back to Flower Street.

42:12.210 --> 42:13.410
Take care.

42:13.590 --> 42:14.710
See you at Flower Street.

42:35.540 --> 42:37.260
Next time when you go to Wanghe's place,

42:38.800 --> 42:40.480
remember to stuff a bubble gum

42:40.480 --> 42:41.610
into his keyhole for me.

42:55.530 --> 43:03.350
[Security Check]
